        "original_id": "5d85f820-56a6-556b-9b00-c6cb5f74f490",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. P. Doherty, Debbie Harry, Cyndi Lauper\n- Tours: True Colors tour, Necessary Evil tour\n- Music Works: \"Necessary Evil\", \"Maybe for Sure\", \"Def, Dumb & Blonde\"\n- Bands: Blondie\n\nFacts:\n- Debbie Harry was born as Angela Tremble on July 1, 1945, and she is an American singer-songwriter and actress best known as the lead singer of Blondie.\n- \"Maybe for Sure\" is a 1989 song by Debbie Harry that was released as a single from her third solo album \"Def, Dumb & Blonde\".\n- In June 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on Cyndi Lauper's True Colors tour.\n- In November and December 2007, J. P. Doherty toured with Debbie Harry on the Necessary Evil tour in support of Harry's 2007 release \"Necessary Evil\".",
